Cell["\<\
Above: The matrix of tight constraints is full rank and has a fractional \
solution.
Below: Multiplying the full LHS matrix A by the implied solution x and \
subtracting it from the RHS vector b give all non-negative entries. That is, \
Ax<=b.\
\>", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9700391365159187`*^9, 3.9700392859332466`*^9}},
